{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L21","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:21"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A callable signal that reads the current atom value when invoked and\nexposes a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".set"},{"type":"text","value":" method matching the atom's native setter contract."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is the Angular-idiomatic return type for "},{"type":"link","href":"../functions/injectAtom.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"injectAtom"}]},{"type":"text","value":". It can\nbe used as a class property and called directly in templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly count = injectAtom(countAtom)\n\n// read in template: {{ count() }}\n// write in class:   this.count.set(5)\n//                   this.count.set(prev => prev + 1)","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"code","value":"WritableAtomSignal(): T;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L23","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:23"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read the current value."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"set","children":[{"type":"text","value":"set"}]},{"type":"code","value":"set: (fn) => void & (value) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L25","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:25"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set the atom value (accepts a direct value or an updater function)."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"set","text":"set","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:21](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L21)\n\nA callable signal that reads the current atom value when invoked and\nexposes a `.set` method matching the atom's native setter contract.\n\nThis is the Angular-idiomatic return type for [injectAtom](../functions/injectAtom.md). It can\nbe used as a class property and called directly in templates.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nreadonly count = injectAtom(countAtom)\n\n// read in template: {{ count() }}\n// write in class:   this.count.set(5)\n//                   this.count.set(prev => prev + 1)\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\n```ts\nWritableAtomSignal(): T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:23](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L23)\n\nRead the current value.\n\n## Returns\n\n`T`\n\n## Properties\n\n### set\n\n```ts\nset: (fn) => void & (value) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L25)\n\nSet the atom value (accepts a direct value or an updater function).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: WritableAtomSignal\ntitle: WritableAtomSignal\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:21](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L21)\n\nA callable signal that reads the current atom value when invoked and\nexposes a `.set` method matching the atom's native setter contract.\n\nThis is the Angular-idiomatic return type for [injectAtom](../functions/injectAtom.md). It can\nbe used as a class property and called directly in templates.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nreadonly count = injectAtom(countAtom)\n\n// read in template: {{ count() }}\n// write in class:   this.count.set(5)\n//                   this.count.set(prev => prev + 1)\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\n```ts\nWritableAtomSignal(): T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:23](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L23)\n\nRead the current value.\n\n## Returns\n\n`T`\n\n## Properties\n\n### set\n\n```ts\nset: (fn) => void & (value) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/angular-store/src/injectAtom.ts#L25)\n\nSet the atom value (accepts a direct value or an updater function).\n"}
